## Status

This closes the `connectionSet` collection-kind and identity semantics for
these two DTOs only. Broad P18-V01 reconciliation remains open. Current-
revision remote CI, native Windows runtime evidence, and Phase 19 remain
outstanding/out of scope. Product change is committed as `05207a17`; the
compatibility documentation and this run record are committed separately.
